
 Project Rules

This repository is for the FlyRank AI Internship FE-01 assignment.

 Stack

- Windows development environment
- Node.js LTS
- Git
- GitHub
- Cursor IDE
- AI-assisted development with Cursor

 Code Conventions

- Keep code simple and readable.
- Prefer clear and descriptive names.
- Avoid unnecessary dependencies.
- Do not introduce unnecessary complexity.
- Review AI-generated code before accepting it.

 Git Conventions

Use Conventional Commits.

 AI Usage

Use AI to assist with planning, reviewing, explaining, and improving code.

Do not blindly accept generated code. Verify the result and understand
important changes before committing them.